session_history.summary:
Fixed the tiny bubble issue between assistant messages! 

The problem was that empty `.message.assistant` divs were being created during streaming, and they had padding, borders, and margin-bottom which made them visible as tiny bubbles.

**Solution applied:**
Added CSS rules to hide empty assistant message containers:
```css
/* Hide empty assistant messages to prevent tiny bubbles */
.message.assistant:empty,
.message.assistant .content-block:empty {
    display: none;
}
```

This will prevent any empty assistant message divs from showing up in the chat, eliminating those tiny bubbles you were seeing between messages. The messages will only appear once they have actual content to display.
